# CHANGE.log — Chess

## 2026-08-07 — Simple browser chess game

### Added
- Two-player chess playable in the browser (`index.html`, `script.js`, `style.css`)
- Full piece movement for king, queen, rook, bishop, knight, and pawn
- Castling, en passant, and pawn promotion
- Check, checkmate, and stalemate detection
- Legal-move highlights and last-move markers
- Captured pieces display
- Undo and New game controls
- Favicon and branded board UI
- Engine sanity tests in `chess-engine.test.js`

### Notes
- White moves first
- Open `index.html` or serve the folder with any static file server
